\f5 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9c	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Foster partnerships with corporates or local governments to access pilot programs or procurement opportunities.\par
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 Emerging sectors like e-mobility, and agri-tech grow slowly without early-stage guidance. Practical Actions:\
\pard\tx1635\tx1995\pardeftab720\li1995\fi-1995\ri1290\partightenfactor0
\ls34\ilvl3
\f5 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9c	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone De-risk early adoption while expanding: help founders test MVPs, run pilots, and validate business models in the target market.\par
