\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\fi1275\sa47\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\b \cf2 Strategic Insights:\par
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\sa159\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Benin\'92s reforms and programs (MCC, Az\'f4li, Circular Economy Roadmap ) are\page 
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 making it a regional sandbox for solar PAYG, recycling, and agri-fintech pilots. DFI and PE \uc0\u64258 ows exceed $1.6B (2020\'962024), positioning Benin as a low-barrier entry market for early-stage ventures. Yet, gaps persist in policy enforcement, workforce readiness, and affordable connectivity. Action for SEED/BDS Providers:\
