\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Sustainable Agriculture & Agri-Tech\par
\pard\tx2355\tx2715\pardeftab720\li2715\fi-2715\ri1301\partightenfactor0
\ls122\ilvl1
\f5 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9b	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone The most common entry point for women-led green businesses across all countries (AfDB).\par
\pard\tx2355\tx2715\pardeftab720\li2715\fi-2715\ri1299\sa4\partightenfactor0
\ls122\ilvl1
\f5 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9b	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Kenya and Benin support climate-smart agribusiness, while Senegal and Togo promote women-run agri-cooperatives.\par
\pard\tx1635\tx1994\tx1994\pardeftab720\li1994\fi-1994\sa91\partightenfactor0
\ls123\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	2.	}
