\f5 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9b	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Still nascent for women and youth-led firms, though e-mobility initiatives in Kenya and Togo show early promise.\par
