\f0\b \cf2 Major green investments (2020\'96present):\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1288\sa4\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Total climate finance reached $441 million, though this covers just 8% of NDC funding needs (Climate Policy Initiative,; West African Alliance ) World Bank Group and partners approved $200 million in development financing (2024 ) to support sustainable agriculture, rural electrification and RE reforms (World Bank, 2024). A\par
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 $69 million World Bank project (Dec 2024 ) is funding a 25 MW solar plant+36 MWh battery (Dapaong). The IFC-led Scaling Solar program launched tenders (60\'9680 MW); EDF/BBOXX and national initiatives are subsidizing thousands of solar pumps and home systems. While the West African Alliance on Carbon Markets facilitated 26 registered VCM projects in Togo generating 230.6K carbon credits (West African Alliance).\

