\f0\b \cf2 Strategic Takeaway: Expansion Potential\par
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1288\sa95\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Togo presents a promising soft-landing ecosystem for green businesses expanding into West Africa\'92s green economy, particularly in solar energy, circular economy, and climate-smart agri-tech. Flagship initiatives such as CIZO and Tinga, paired with active donor engagement and infrastructure readiness, position Togo as a testbed for decentralized solutions.\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 Green businesses from neighboring markets or with replicable business models\'97such as micro-recycling units, PAYG solar kits, or solar-powered\page \pard\pardeftab720\tightenfactor0
\cf2 \par
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 e-mobility solutions\'97can scale into Togo by leveraging subsidies, municipal partnerships, and donor-funded programs.\

