\f0\b \cf2 Fact sheet - Benin\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1303\sa5\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Emerging Hub for Circular Innovation, Decentralized Energy, and AgriTech Experimentation.\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\fi1275\sa58\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Country Snapshot\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa5\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Benin\'92s population reached 14.45 million in 2025, with GDP growth surging to 7.5% on the back of a strong services sector and robust agricultural activity. Despite modest per capita GDP ($1,300), the country is laying strong groundwork for a diversified green economy. Green sectors now contribute 9.2% of formal jobs, with growth in solar energy, waste valorization, and sustainable agriculture driving early green businesses activity.\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\fi1275\sa58\qj\partightenfactor0

