\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 With 90% of electricity imported, Benin is fast-tracking its energy independence through solar, backed by the Millennium Challenge Compact and updated energy laws.\
