\f0\b \cf2 Strategic Takeaway: Expansion Potential\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1295\sa159\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Benin is emerging as a regional sandbox for innovation in circular economy, solar energy, and agri-fintech, offering fertile ground for regional green businesses to pilot, adapt, and scale their models. Governmental reforms (e.g. Circular Economy Roadmap, MCC solar tenders), combined with a strong urban-rural divide, create opportunities for early movers deploying IoT-enabled irrigation, micro-recycling systems, and traceability platforms.\page 
