\f0\b \cf2 Fact sheet - Senegal\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\fi1275\ri1288\sa3\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf2 West Africa\'92s Clean Tech Gateway with Strong Wind Power, Urban Circular Models, and Agritech Uptake\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 Country Snapshot\

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1289\sa5\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Senegal\'92s population grew to 19.4 million by 2025, with urbanization nearing 50%. The economy expanded by 6.9% in 2024, bolstered by oil & gas production and stabilized in\uc0\u64258 ation. Agriculture still employs 30% of the workforce, yet green sectors are on the rise, contributing 11.2% of formal employment. The country benefits from a blend of donor engagement, bold policies (e.g. 2021 Energy Transition Law), and IPP-friendly regulation.\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\fi1275\sa59\partightenfactor0

