\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone PAYG solar home systems (e.g. M-KOPA)\par
\ls218\ilvl1
\f5 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9c	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Grid-tied and off-grid solar systems, especially in rural/remote regions\par
