\ls218\ilvl1
\f5 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9c	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Battery and storage integration, EPC and maintenance services\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 The government aims to add another 1\'962 GW of renewable power by 2030, offering sustained room for innovators in solar tech, distribution, and micro-utilities.\
\pard\tx1275\tx1530\pardeftab720\li1530\fi-1530\sa159\partightenfactor0
\ls219\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	2.	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Electric Mobility
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 Kenya is rapidly electrifying transport with Nairobi at the forefront. BasiGo and Roam are piloting EV buses and electric motorcycles with \'93Pay-as-you-Drive\'94 models for matatus and boda-bodas.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li1500\sa59\partightenfactor0
