\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 Agriculture contributes 23% of GDP and employs 75% of rural households. Drought, land degradation, and erratic rainfall have increased demand for tech-based resilience.\
