\f0\b \cf2 Strategic Takeaway: Expansion Potential\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1294\sa159\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 Kenya is a mature green economy and a regional launchpad for green businesses targeting East African growth, especially in geothermal, solar irrigation, e-mobility, and clean cooking. Nairobi\'92s position as a continental cleantech hub, with robust investment infrastructure and active climate finance \uc0\u64258 ows, makes it ideal for green businesses ready to scale tested models into dynamic markets.\page 
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 Incoming green businesses in electric mobility, solar agri-tech, or clean cooking can benefit from policy alignment, co-investment channels, and a deep BDS provider landscape.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 For green businesses scaling into Kenya, BDS providers should:\

\pard\tx1635\tx1995\pardeftab720\li1995\fi-1995\sa91\partightenfactor0
\ls235\ilvl1
