\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Leverage Kenya\'92s accelerator and investor networks for soft-landing.\par
\ls235\ilvl1
\f5 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9c	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Help structure asset-financing and carbon monetization strategies;\par
\pard\tx1635\tx1995\pardeftab720\li1995\fi-1995\ri1291\sa244\partightenfactor0
\ls235\ilvl1
\f5 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9c	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Facilitate partnerships with local corporations and utilities to support scale-up and localization.\par
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1289\sa91\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'93We\'92re seeing more investor appetite shift toward B2B software for energy e
ciency and smart agriculture, less capital intensive, more scalable,\'94 notes Florent Nduwayezu, a climate tech investor from FP Capital. Sectors like climate-AI intersections and satellite-enabled smart farming are showing more momentum compared to traditional solar or recycling models.\page 
