\f0\b \cf2 Fact sheet - South Africa\par


\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1299\sa4\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Africa\'92s Largest Economy Turning Green: Massive Infrastructure Shifts, EVs, Hydrogen, and Circular Economy Growth\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\fi1275\sa94\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Country Snapshot\par
\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1289\sa5\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 South Africa, with a GDP of $420 billion and a population of 60 million, is Africa\'92s most industrialized economy. However, it has long relied on coal (70\'9675% of electricity generation). Since 2021, the country has accelerated its green shift through a $8.5B Just Energy Transition Partnership (JETP), liberalized energy markets, and new industrial strategies. Green sectors are rising in in\uc0\u64258 uence, particularly wind and solar, green hydrogen, electric mobility, and circular industries.\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\fi1275\sa98\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Green Market Opportunities for green businesses\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 According to GreenCape, South Africa\'92s green economy maturity is driven primarily by necessity, especially around energy security and pricing. While renewable energy remains the top sector, strong upward trends are noted in water and sustainable agriculture due to recent policy shifts and crisis responses like Day Zero.\par
\pard\tx1275\tx1474\pardeftab720\li1474\fi-1474\sa63\partightenfactor0
\ls236\ilvl0
\f2 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone 	1.
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Renewable Energy and Grid Innovation\par

\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 South Africa has installed 6.5 GW of wind and solar through the REIPPPP since 2011. The 2023 Integrated resource Plan envisions 29.5 GW of new renewables by 2030 (14.4 GW wind, 6 GW solar). The Electricity Regulation Amendment Act (2024 ) opens the market to private generators and independent transmission, reshaping how green businesses can participate.\
\pard\pardeftab720\li1500\sa59\partightenfactor0
