\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 South Africa is pioneering green hydrogen with pilot hubs in the Northern and Western Cape (e.g. Sasol\'92s Hyphen project). The country is also pushing electric vehicle assembly, with VW and Toyota building local EV capacity.\
