\f0\b \cf2 Green businesses Takeaways:\par
\pard\tx2355\tx2715\pardeftab720\li2715\fi-2715\ri1297\partightenfactor0
\ls254\ilvl0
\f5\b0 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\'81\'9b	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone SA offers scale opportunities in solar, agri, and mobility, but early capital is tight.\par
