\pard\pardeftab720\li1275\ri1291\sa241\qj\partightenfactor0\n\f1\b0 \cf2 South Africa\'92s financial institutions remain risk-averse. Both early-stage green businesses and scale-ready SMEs struggle with financing, even when they have confirmed purchase orders. \'93Even those who identify as angel or seed investors often only intervene much too late in the journey,\'94 says Cuan Solomon from Greencape.\

